Related-key scan over a pay-to-public-key corpus
==========================================================================

Tests whether any two private keys differ by a small offset. If so,
P_j = P_i + delta*G, which is visible from public keys alone. This is the
failure class behind the Debian OpenSSL and Android SecureRandom losses.

